cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ClaudeBar in your tools or publications, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ClaudeBar"
abstract: >
  A tiny open-source macOS menu bar app that shows how much of your Claude
  plan you've used. A colored ring follows your most-used limit, and its menu
  lists the 5-hour, weekly and per-model weekly limits with reset times.
  Built from source in one Swift file with no dependencies.
authors:
